  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training in Agroecological Culture for the Rooting of the Indigenous Pa Tavytera of the Amamabay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Illicit activities and the lack of jobs in Paraguay&apos;s Concepcin Department hinder economic and community development. Asociacin Pa Tavytera RekoPave (APTR) helps indigenous families especially women and young people improve organic agricultural production cultivate traditional crops and develop a more reliable food supply. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to expand economic development in Paraguay. APTR&apos;s activities promote smallholder agriculture and food production to enhance food security and ensure meaningful opportunities for communities to thrive.</narrative>
  </description>
